R-CH15 R-UP6 R-RP1 R-U3 (slice 243, user decision of 2026-11-12): `tln upgrade roc` on `=<user id>` runs the check loop of a nightly header pin over the newer builds of the channel; the newest build that passes goes into talon.toml (`~ [toolchain] roc: =<old> -> =<new>`); with no newer build the is-the-newest line. The probe count and the 'resolved at' line are guessed (TW24); calls.log is baked from the real run later.
